                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83b6c962-f184-3fc4-b6cb-9aad514dec3c",
                        "entry_id": "43c63bcd-8cc0-3a5b-8459-90a7d4bc8cde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "архит. вертикальная конструкция, представляющая собой либо выступающую часть стены, вертикальное ребро, либо отдельно стоящую опору, связанную со стеной аркбутаном"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48cd668c-a20b-49cb-8656-75a2a58c3651",
                                "sense_id": "83b6c962-f184-3fc4-b6cb-9aad514dec3c",
                                "text": "По планам, строительным приёмам, отсутствию балок и контрфорсов постройки позднего халколита резко отличаются от описанных выше домов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8038a3ff-20a6-4c4a-86a1-d97f8db82a84",
                        "source_entry_id": "43c63bcd-8cc0-3a5b-8459-90a7d4bc8cde",
                        "source_sense_id": "83b6c962-f184-3fc4-b6cb-9aad514dec3c",
                        "target_lang_word": "buttress",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "buttress",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08ae7d8d-f561-3f1a-9e9e-236a8e1d422c",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2b4475-783d-3a44-93aa-7b6c3cbf1034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brick, concrete or stone structure built against another structure to support it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2cb873c-4962-4166-bbb3-ce03c2627dc9",
                                                "sense_id": "08ae7d8d-f561-3f1a-9e9e-236a8e1d422c",
                                                "text": "It was decided, therefore, to build eight concrete buttresses from the new strengthening work to safeguard the general stability of the wall along the length where the greatest movement had taken place."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ec1c03d-1641-37ca-9bcc-bb4d868cf95c",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2b4475-783d-3a44-93aa-7b6c3cbf1034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that serves to support something; a prop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8510be49-59a1-3e79-9622-2b9aa0cd4348",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2b4475-783d-3a44-93aa-7b6c3cbf1034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A buttress-root."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5d1f9f0-ca5e-3cc9-890f-6dab6d1523a1",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2b4475-783d-3a44-93aa-7b6c3cbf1034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feature jutting prominently out from a mountain or rock."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c66f4eba-15a3-4c90-b244-e5d6fd349791",
                                                "sense_id": "b5d1f9f0-ca5e-3cc9-890f-6dab6d1523a1",
                                                "text": "Crowell Buttresses, Dismal Buttress"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef427922-7727-40ac-ad2b-81d57f774b5a",
                                                "sense_id": "b5d1f9f0-ca5e-3cc9-890f-6dab6d1523a1",
                                                "text": "All that day they rode into broken land. The prairie with its grass and rolling hills was behind them, and they entered a sparse, dry, rocky country, full of draws and short cañons and ominous buttresses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b62faac4-12e9-4191-b048-b744205a7c43",
                                                "sense_id": "b5d1f9f0-ca5e-3cc9-890f-6dab6d1523a1",
                                                "text": "Two short pitches up a chimney-crack are followed by a traverse right to the centre of the buttress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c102271-607b-38f6-936d-c6e4ad893913",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2b4475-783d-3a44-93aa-7b6c3cbf1034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that supports or strengthens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d295e774-1b99-416f-8550-369fc07a6f3f",
                                                "sense_id": "7c102271-607b-38f6-936d-c6e4ad893913",
                                                "text": "the grand pillar and buttress of the good old cause of nonconformity"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "buttress",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "731de85c-6500-3fe2-bb0a-b68d1e0ba799",
                                        "entry_id": "105c3f9a-20e8-3de2-b690-b2d62785ccf2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To support something physically with, or as if with, a prop or buttress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20afcbab-79e1-3f3f-8170-6cfc9505f4ac",
                                        "entry_id": "105c3f9a-20e8-3de2-b690-b2d62785ccf2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To support something or someone by supplying evidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18609d6c-f334-4f00-be43-d840a7fd494a",
                                                "sense_id": "20afcbab-79e1-3f3f-8170-6cfc9505f4ac",
                                                "text": "Buttressed by elaborate account statements and a deep reservoir of trust from his investors and regulators, Mr. Madoff steered his fraud scheme safely through a severe recession in the early 1990s, a global financial crisis in 1998 and the anxious aftermath of the terrorist attacks in September 2001."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "49825745-73a3-4da5-8460-4920080eb446",
                        "source_entry_id": "43c63bcd-8cc0-3a5b-8459-90a7d4bc8cde",
                        "source_sense_id": "83b6c962-f184-3fc4-b6cb-9aad514dec3c",
                        "target_lang_word": "abutment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "abutment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63380f74-d8f0-3209-8653-85464a0c5560",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The point of junction between two things, in particular a support, that abuts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c572699-dca4-31ff-b640-34bd1b022468",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The solid portion of a structure that supports the lateral pressure of an arch or vault."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb2f0f67-72e2-33dd-970e-167a0f354aa6",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A construction that supports the ends of a bridge; a structure that anchors the cables on a suspension bridge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "378910e4-b693-4bff-8daa-cf6bc1aa70cd",
                                                "sense_id": "fb2f0f67-72e2-33dd-970e-167a0f354aa6",
                                                "text": "Each of the bridges consists of six separate girder spans on brick abutments."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff8b8d91-1e93-306c-85a1-72c7609b0c49",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of a valley or canyon wall against which a dam is constructed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7922b96-fe9b-4ba4-8749-b57b1d3b4104",
                                                "sense_id": "ff8b8d91-1e93-306c-85a1-72c7609b0c49",
                                                "text": "Heavy rains have caused the dam's abutments to seep, raising concern over possible dam failure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9de6e8cf-7246-3de2-befa-88016cd7db12",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that abuts, or on which something abuts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0f760cd-e6e9-3564-9777-c5e6349babb5",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of abutting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad34864b-5f84-3cb2-bb30-4b717593cd08",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That element that shares a common boundary or surface with its neighbor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc589906-d458-3d94-b57a-037d0f5a4eff",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The tooth that supports a denture or bridge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5040a7fb-b856-3655-9c75-824e80f5c706",
                                        "entry_id": "9bdea313-9b4d-3e0c-9dbe-0f78e1c944d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fixed point or surface where resistance is obtained."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8226452-22c9-418c-bfa4-aebbf308b1d6",
                                                "sense_id": "5040a7fb-b856-3655-9c75-824e80f5c706",
                                                "text": "The fulcrum acted as an abutment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12432aa1-fe28-4edf-ba1e-ac406c410d13",
                        "source_entry_id": "43c63bcd-8cc0-3a5b-8459-90a7d4bc8cde",
                        "source_sense_id": "83b6c962-f184-3fc4-b6cb-9aad514dec3c",
                        "target_lang_word": "counterfort",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "counterfort",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d52b61a2-8275-37e2-9b73-72c29ba0f3dc",
                                        "entry_id": "7fbddb59-84c5-326a-b333-647e65b7e50e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A buttress built against a wall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2290d273-f043-4ba8-a1a8-2d7eae81935b",
                                                "sense_id": "d52b61a2-8275-37e2-9b73-72c29ba0f3dc",
                                                "text": "This involved new track drainage, strengthening of embankments and cuttings and the provision of counterforts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0ac9231-2fda-4406-8ea5-d2965d818d43",
                                                "sense_id": "d52b61a2-8275-37e2-9b73-72c29ba0f3dc",
                                                "text": "The soil above the base of a reinforced concrete cantilever or counterfort wall is included as part of the weight of the wall in stability calculations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80b12abc-8937-4dba-8273-8ae7ab7d35f1",
                                                "sense_id": "d52b61a2-8275-37e2-9b73-72c29ba0f3dc",
                                                "text": "Mair reports work described in 1844 to install counterforts in slopes, which were typically trenches that were two metres wide and around eight metres apart. They were dug down one metre and backfilled with gravel or rubble stone to provide internal buttresses and deep drains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54916556-1506-395e-9ebc-db1fcfd53da9",
                                        "entry_id": "7fbddb59-84c5-326a-b333-647e65b7e50e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spur of a mountain range."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a5f6e46-3fe6-4792-a144-7b04c882891d",
                                                "sense_id": "54916556-1506-395e-9ebc-db1fcfd53da9",
                                                "text": "With its counterforts projecting some 300 miles, [the Pamir] forms the western headland of all the plateaux and mountain systems skirting the Chinese Empire; it completely separates the two halves of Asia, and forms an almost impassable barrier to migration and warlike incursions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0926c3f3-5c19-4ad4-8ee3-6bded8c95d04",
                                                "sense_id": "54916556-1506-395e-9ebc-db1fcfd53da9",
                                                "text": "This angle is buttressed from the interior by an enormous counterfort of lower mountain country, extending several hundred miles to the eastward, forming the main part of the highlands of Bolivia, and separating the tributaries of the Amazon"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bfaff5d-d7df-440c-b744-2a299abcacb9",
                                                "sense_id": "54916556-1506-395e-9ebc-db1fcfd53da9",
                                                "text": "The physical impossibility of the line along the counterfort or mountain range from Punta Mona was easily demonstrated, for the very simple reason that no such counterfort or mountain range existed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4806d01c-32e2-42a8-91ef-6458efd4d1df",
                        "source_entry_id": "43c63bcd-8cc0-3a5b-8459-90a7d4bc8cde",
                        "source_sense_id": "83b6c962-f184-3fc4-b6cb-9aad514dec3c",
                        "target_lang_word": "contrefort",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "contrefort",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04d21135-302c-32a6-b547-84edc5aedd7a",
                                        "entry_id": "de29a3a4-0070-3cf4-86f9-87b49bb350c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mur servant d’appui à un autre mur pour éviter que ce dernier ne boucle sous l’effet d’une poussée latérale causée, entre autres, par le soutènement d’une terrasse ou d’une voûte."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84158631-41b1-4ce0-9d7e-67233c73a83b",
                                                "sense_id": "04d21135-302c-32a6-b547-84edc5aedd7a",
                                                "text": "Il n’en reste qu’un portail composé de trois arcades ; … De chaque côté de l’une d’elles, après un contrefort, une longue petite fenêtre cintrée va s’évasant du dehors comme les meurtrières d’une forteresse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "213917a3-b8e9-46d2-8993-1711e1c272ef",
                                                "sense_id": "04d21135-302c-32a6-b547-84edc5aedd7a",
                                                "text": "REIMS – […] Le chevet est admirable, c’est un chef-d’œuvre comme celui de Cologne ; mais différent, et combien supérieur à la sotte armature de contreforts à la façon d’un crabe, de Notre-Dame de Paris !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a243b6d2-3938-42e2-874c-b73d549b6ca0",
                                                "sense_id": "04d21135-302c-32a6-b547-84edc5aedd7a",
                                                "text": "L’antique carrière de la Grèce archaïque, dite de la Corderie, a été mise au jour sur les contreforts de Notre-Dame-de-la-Garde par la fouille de l’Institut national de recherches archéologiques préventives (Inrap)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8e09a01-2924-3b87-aa73-db0551b0bbae",
                                        "entry_id": "de29a3a4-0070-3cf4-86f9-87b49bb350c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chaînes de montagnes latérales qui sont comme les appuis de la chaîne principale dont elles dépendent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c6c587e-6495-4d49-8c26-b926e20ba39f",
                                                "sense_id": "a8e09a01-2924-3b87-aa73-db0551b0bbae",
                                                "text": "Si, dans les contreforts du Vercors, vous entendez un cri de loup, ne vous inquiétez pas tout de suite. C’est le rituel de techniciens de l’Office français de la biodiversité, qui poussent le cri du loup dans un cône de chantier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "080ac59a-a601-33c8-81a5-7be0e4afb864",
                                        "entry_id": "de29a3a4-0070-3cf4-86f9-87b49bb350c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bordure d’une montagne ou d’un causse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2e70e2d-6ccd-4869-bc01-8b289d301178",
                                                "sense_id": "080ac59a-a601-33c8-81a5-7be0e4afb864",
                                                "text": "Selon les caprices du rail, un sommet apparaissait brusquement pour s’effacer tout aussi vite derrière une épaulée ou un contrefort."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70dd703c-bb3b-3ed3-a6ff-32e8ad75f325",
                                        "entry_id": "de29a3a4-0070-3cf4-86f9-87b49bb350c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pièce de cuir dont on fortifie le derrière de la chaussure au dessus du talon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Cordonnerie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1170788c-817c-42db-819a-4d5a3b34a101",
                                                "sense_id": "70dd703c-bb3b-3ed3-a6ff-32e8ad75f325",
                                                "text": "Par terre, une paire d’escarpins qui, contrefort cassé, semelle trouée, servaient de pantoufles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3067197-36d9-4066-9384-350412be7571",
                                                "sense_id": "70dd703c-bb3b-3ed3-a6ff-32e8ad75f325",
                                                "text": "Hedwige suivait, assez crispée elle aussi : d’abord parce qu’elle n’était, de la part de Pierre, l’objet d’aucune attention particulière, et ensuite parce qu’elle avait mal au pied, à cause d’un contrefort neuf."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a3b5656-159b-3f5d-a515-f07ede8f8907",
                                        "entry_id": "de29a3a4-0070-3cf4-86f9-87b49bb350c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Racine-contrefort."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa71bbb6-6116-491b-ba09-52caf27688b7",
                                                "sense_id": "2a3b5656-159b-3f5d-a515-f07ede8f8907",
                                                "text": "Cette interrogation a retenu notre attention car, dans un modeste travail […], nous avions signalé la possibilité d’existence de contreforts dans la zone tempérée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
